{"availability":"available","full":"puikinsh/srtdash-admin-dashboard","name":"srtdash-admin-dashboard","description":"Free Bootstrap 5.3.8 admin dashboard template for crypto and finance SaaS ","category":"Design","language":"HTML","stars":515,"forks":258,"created":"2018-10-01T14:32:04Z","updated":"2026-09-03T19:24:24Z","license":"MIT","branch":"master","homepage":"https://colorlib.com/polygon/srtdash/index.html","topics":["admin","admin-dashboard","admin-dashboard-template","admin-dashboard-ui","admin-panel","admin-template","admin-ui","bootstrap","bootstrap-5","css","dashboard","dashboard-template","dashboard-templates","dashboards","html"],"demo":"https://colorlib.com/polygon/srtdash/index.html","color":"#302e55","ink":"#dbd2ff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-04T16:11:24.484Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-04T16:11:24.484Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-04T16:11:24.484Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-03T14:32:48.258Z","stars":515,"forks":258},{"at":"2026-10-04T16:11:24.484Z","stars":515,"forks":258}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["SRTdash is a free, multipurpose admin dashboard template designed for web applications, SaaS products, and back-office panels. It ships with 56 ready-to-use pages covering everything from analytics dashboards and data tables to chat, email, file management, user profiles, and full authentication flows — all built on Bootstrap 5.3.8 with pure vanilla JavaScript. No jQuery, no build tools, no framework lock-in.","The template features four distinct dashboard layouts (ICO/Crypto, Ecommerce, SEO/Marketing, and a horizontal-menu variant), each populated with realistic demo data rendered through Chart.js, Highcharts, ZingChart, and AmCharts. Every page is fully responsive, accessible out of the box (skip links, focus-visible, reduced-motion support), and optimized with AVIF images, modern font loading, and a GA4 tracking placeholder.","Whether you are bootstrapping an internal tool, prototyping a client project, or learning Bootstrap 5, SRTdash gives you a polished starting point with clean, modular code you can understand and extend in minutes."],"features":["56 pages — 4 dashboard variants, 9 app pages, 25+ UI components, auth flows, error pages","Zero jQuery — every interaction is vanilla JavaScript","Bootstrap 5.3.8 — latest stable release, Popper bundled","4 charting libraries — Chart.js 4, Highcharts 12, ZingChart, AmCharts","AVIF images with JPG/PNG fallback on every image"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/puikinsh/srtdash-admin-dashboard/blob/master/README.md","fingerprint":"6341c414e2d482fc7f9212f5fc406f4074b6d112474893bd64872b05a64cc474","extractedAt":"2026-10-03T06:25:47.468Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-03T10:47:35.264Z","overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-09-03T19:24:24Z","lastDemoCheckedAt":"2026-10-03T10:47:35.276Z","overviewAttemptAt":"2026-10-03T09:40:16.979Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"SRTdash is a free, multipurpose admin dashboard template designed for web applications, SaaS products, and back-office panels. It ships with 56 ready-to-use pages covering everything from analytics dashboards and data tables to chat, email, file management, user profiles, and full authentication flows — all built on Bootstrap 5.3.8 with pure vanilla JavaScript. No jQuery, no build tools, no framework lock-in.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/puikinsh/srtdash-admin-dashboard/blob/master/README.md"},"audience":[{"text":"SRTdash is a free, multipurpose admin dashboard template designed for web applications, SaaS products, and back-office panels. It ships with 56 ready-to-use pages covering everything from analytics dashboards and data tables to chat, email, file management, user profiles, and full authentication flows — all built on Bootstrap 5.3.8 with pure vanilla JavaScript. No jQuery, no…","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/puikinsh/srtdash-admin-dashboard/blob/master/README.md"}],"requirements":[{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"Login (3 variants), R